# m5_graze: the m2_play sweep (without its two holds) plus B held for updates 1630..1649, so
# the bar is spent before the ship meets bullets and a graze can show up in it (a full bar
# would cap the grant). Since M7 it plays in the endless probe mode (debug_probe at 31; a
# normal game dies on this sweep), and the hold moved from 1960 to 1600 to find a clean graze
# in the M7 waves, then to 1630 for the catch-up table clock (a thin field runs the stage
# table faster; at 1600 the ship never re-lived the graze it took back). Re-pinned for the
# mode paces (NORMAL: the table clock hurries only on an empty field, the fire ramp counts
# real ticks): the waves come later and fire less, so the counts are lower, but the hold at
# 1630 still takes back a graze that the ship then re-lives. 1629: game tick 1599, fuel 180,
# 8 grazes, 3 probe hits. 1649, the last held frame: 20 frames = 40 ticks, game tick 1559,
# fuel 140; the hold took back the graze of 1597 (grazes 7; no probe hit falls inside it this
# time, hits stay 3). 1650: PLAYING, no tick.
# - 1666 (tick 1575): the ship grazes again: grazes 7 -> 8, but it is under the graze
#   high-water mark, so it pays nothing (fuel 142 before and after).
# - 1753 (tick 1662): a new graze: grazes 8 -> 9 and fuel 151 -> 153. Refill alone cannot
#   get there: 103 live ticks since the release (1559 -> 1662) give at most 140 + (9 + 103) /
#   10 = 151 (9 = the most the refill counter can carry in), and the fuel is 153.
# (Under the catch-up clock: 13 grazes and 6 hits at 1629, the re-lived graze at 1678, the new
# one at 1772.)
# No rewind is spent (probe mode never rewinds; rewinds stay 3).
--frames 2200 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_rewinds,debug_fuel,debug_grazes --at "1629 debug_state == 1" --at "1629 debug_game_tick == 1599" --at "1629 debug_fuel == 180" --at "1629 debug_grazes == 8" --at "1629 debug_hits == 3" --at "1630 debug_state == 5" --at "1649 debug_game_tick == 1559" --at "1649 debug_fuel == 140" --at "1649 debug_grazes == 7" --at "1649 debug_hits == 3" --at "1650 debug_state == 1" --at "1660 debug_history_check == 0" --at "1665 debug_grazes == 7" --at "1665 debug_fuel == 142" --at "1666 debug_grazes == 8" --at "1666 debug_fuel == 142" --at "1752 debug_grazes == 8" --at "1752 debug_fuel == 151" --at "1753 debug_game_tick == 1662" --at "1753 debug_grazes == 9" --at "1753 debug_fuel == 153" --at "1753 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_rewinds == 3" --expect "debug_grazes >= 9"
